  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 4 + 2 ÷ 7 + 8 × 9 = 25 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs and numbers:\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 4 and 9, + and × \n\n4 + 2 ÷ 7 + 8 × 9 = 25 ⇒ 9 × **2 ÷ 7**__ × 8 + 4 = 25\n\n__**9 ×**____** **__**__0.28__**__** ×**____** 8**__ + 4 = 25\n\n__**20.16 + 4**__ = 25\n\n24.16 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 4 and 7, ÷ and × ​\n\n4 + 2 ÷ 7 + 8 × 9 = 25 ⇒ 7 + 2 × 4 + **8 ÷ 9**__ = 25\n\n7 + __**2 **____**× 4**__ + 0.88 = 25\n\n__**7 + 8 + 0.88**__ = 25\n\n15.88 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 4 and 9, ÷ and × \n\n4 + 2 ÷ 7 + 8 × 9 = 25 ⇒ 9 + 2 × 7 + **8 ÷ 4**__ = 25\n\n9 + __**2 **____**×**____** 7**__ + 2 = 25\n\n__**9 + 14 + 2**__ = 25\n\n25 = 25 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 4 and 7, + and × \n\n4 + 2 ÷ 7 + 8 × 9 = 25 ⇒ 7 × **2 ÷ 4**__ × 8 + 9 = 25\n\n__**7 × **__**__0.5__**__** × 8**__ + 9 = 25\n\n__**28 + 9**__ = 25\n\n37 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
